{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29577","headline":"有感二首 二 · 李商隐","name":"有感二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹陛犹敷奏，彤庭歘战争。\n临危对卢植，始悔用庞萌。\n御仗收前殿，兵徒剧背城。\n苍黄五色棒，掩遏一阳生。\n古有清君侧，今非乏老成。\n素心虽未易，此举太无名。\n谁瞑衔冤目，宁吞欲绝声。\n近闻开寿讌，不废用咸英。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}